  "headline": "President Prabowo Weighs Potential Candidates For Vice President",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Evaluates New Vice Presidential Candidates",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto is considering potential candidates for the vice presidency, with several names emerging from political party discussions.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto holds the prerogative to determine the replacement candidate for the vice presidency.",
    "Prominent figures currently mentioned in public discourse include Yusril Ihza Mahendra, Ahmad Muzani, and Sufmi Dasco.",
    "Official submissions of the candidates to the MPR are expected to be made by the President on November 25."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following discussions regarding the vice presidency, various political figures have been linked to the position to support President Prabowo Subianto's administration. Reports indicate that Sufmi Dasco, Ahmad Muzani, and Yusril Ihza Mahendra are among those considered for the role. Officials have emphasized that the final selection remains the President's prerogative, though the process involves consultation with coalition partners. While some parties have confirmed they are not putting forward internal candidates, the selection process is moving toward a formal presentation. According to reports from Golkar, President Prabowo is scheduled to submit two candidate names directly to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) on November 25. The criteria mentioned for potential candidates include strong loyalty and obedience to the President's leadership, with specific focus on individuals capable of advancing legal reforms and national supremacy.",
